{"id":"3addbba74174d397","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-graph-vertex-set.md","title":"ZFC Graph Vertex Set","display":"df-zfc-graph-vertex-set — ZFC Graph Vertex Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-vertex-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-vertex-set"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-vertex-set — ZFC Graph Vertex Set","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-vertex-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-vertex-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-vertex-set — ZFC Graph Vertex Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (graph code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (candidate vertex set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> (simple-graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GraphVertexSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{GraphVertexSet}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}vertex\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{GraphVertexSet}(V,G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists E\\;(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}vertex\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{GraphVertexSet}(V,G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists E\\;(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This definition follows the ordered-pair graph code of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a> and does not assume an undeclared adjacency operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (graph code, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S$ (simple-graph predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This definition follows the ordered-pair graph code of [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]] and does not assume an undeclared adjacency operator.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GraphVertexSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}vertex\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{GraphVertexSet}(V,G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\exists E\\;(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle)","display":true}],"bytes":888,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2258","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-graph-vertex-set.md|58-df-zfc-graph-vertex-set]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["0dc79ccc1050ee64"]}